{"version":1,"id":"5-seconds-of-summer-amnesia","title":"Amnesia","artist":"5 Seconds of Summer","key":"D","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/5-seconds-of-summer/amnesia/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Louis Biancaniello, Sam Watters, Joel Madden, Michael Biancaniello and Benjamin Madden","chords":[{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em7","canonical":"Em7","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D/C#","canonical":"D/C#","keyboardPitchClasses":[],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I drove by all the places we used to hang out getting wasted","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"I thought about our last kiss, how it felt the way you tasted","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"And even though your friends tell me you're doing fine","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Are you somewhere feeling lonely even though he's right beside you?","columns":67,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"When he says those words that hurt you, do you read the ones I Wrote you?","columns":73,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Sometimes I start to wonder, was it just a lie?","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"If what we had was real, how could you be fine?","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Cause I'm not fine at all","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I remember the day you told me you were leaving","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D/C#","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"I remember the make-up running down your face","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"And the dreams you left behind you didn't need them","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D/C#","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Like every single wish we ever made","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"I wish that I could wake up with amnesia","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D/C#","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"And forget about the stupid little things","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Like the way it felt to fall asleep next to you","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D/C#","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"And the memories I never can escape","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Cause I'm not fine at all","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"instrumental","text":"(   )","columns":5,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"The pictures that you sent me they're still living in my phone","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I admit I like to see them, I admit I feel alone","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"And all my friends keep asking why I'm not around","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"It hurts to know you're happy, yeah, it hurts that you've moved on","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"It's hard to hear your name when I haven't seen you in so long","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"It's like we never happened, was it just a lie?","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"If what we had was real, how could you be fine?","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em7","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I'm not fine at all","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","te